<p>President Trump sharply criticized Pope Leo XIV in social media posts and remarks to reporters on April 12-13 after the pontiff condemned the U.S.-Israeli war on Iran and called Trump’s threat to destroy Iranian civilization “truly unacceptable”. Trump called the U.S.-born pope “weak on crime,” “terrible for foreign policy,” and “a very liberal person,” and said he was “not a big fan” of Leo, opening a rare public clash between the White House and the Vatican. The dispute reflects a broader split over war, migration and moral authority. Pope Leo, described as the first U.S.-born pope, has emerged as a prominent critic of the Iran war and of the Trump administration’s immigration crackdown, while urging peace and reflection from a Christian perspective. The exchange matters well beyond Washington because it pits two globally influential American figures against each other at a time when the conflict with Iran is already straining international diplomacy and public debate.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/OO0WMg7EXs4Si0XI8EzJoZXlKWCsJcelOuqXqOUJXRMx2hgbtZPuuTIXwvifkeY-BesDHvihUJ6m5R0SVJre3wj-_MFRe0xv3JjC3ayHowK08edkeyQCOo9kfJxRcOyZD9VyPYcpcvY10SQnozwTBBQclFpDWh87VWUN6x5QJVoLnDNpe0Ig888Tv3m9LfTLFvZLqjYiCn7Z_4niXw55QRHZVQ' alt='Pope Leo XIV appears in coverage of the growing public dispute with President Trump over the Iran war.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Brother invoked: Trump said he preferred the pope’s brother, Louis Prevost of Florida, because he is “all MAGA,” making the family contrast part of his public criticism.</li><li>Religious appeal: Leo wrote on X that “God does not bless any conflict” and said followers of Christ should not side with those who “drop bombs,” framing his opposition in explicitly theological terms.</li><li>Visual post: Politico reported Trump followed his comments with an image portraying himself as a Christ-like healer with eagles and jet planes overhead, escalating the symbolism of the dispute.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>President Trump: Trump said he does not want a pope who criticizes the U.S. president for carrying out the agenda he says voters elected him to pursue, and he linked that argument to national security and crime policy. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/trump-pope-leo-weak-on-crime-iran-truth-social/'>CBS News</a>)</li><li>Pope Leo XIV: Leo has argued that threatening to destroy Iranian civilization is morally unacceptable because it targets an entire people, framing his opposition to the Iran war as a matter of conscience rather than strategy. (<a href='https://www.ft.com/content/5cfc03ff-6966-46fd-a62f-01b2452402dc'>Financial Times</a>)</li><li>PBS NewsHour: PBS framed the clash as historically unusual because the relationship between Washington and the Vatican now centers on two Americans, a dynamic that gives the disagreement extra symbolic weight around the world. (<a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/a-president-and-a-pope-two-of-the-worlds-most-influential-americans-at-odds-over-iran'>PBS NewsHour</a>)</li><li>The Guardian: The Guardian emphasized how personal the dispute became, with Trump extending his Truth Social attack into live remarks and saying Leo was “not doing a very good job” while urging him to stop “catering to the Radical Left.” (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/13/donald-trump-pope-leo'>The Guardian</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.ft.com/content/5cfc03ff-6966-46fd-a62f-01b2452402dc'>Donald Trump lashes Pope Leo on social media for criticism of Iran war</a> - ft.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/not-a-big-fan-of-pope-leo-trumps-jab-after-his-criticism-of-iran-war-11349147#publisher=newsstand'>&quot;Not A Big Fan Of Pope Leo&quot;: Trump&#x27;s Jab After His Criticism Of Iran War</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/trump-attacks-pope-leo-calling-him-weak-on-crime-and-terrible'>Trump attacks Pope Leo, calling him ‘terrible’ for foreign policy and ‘weak’ on crime</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/4/13/terrible-for-foreign-policy-trump-attacks-pope-leo-after-peace-appeal'>‘Terrible for foreign policy’: Trump attacks Pope Leo after peace appeal</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.boston.com/news/politics/2026/04/12/trump-lambasts-pope-leo-xiv-extending-feud-over-iran-war-with-first-american-pontiff/'>Trump lambasts Pope Leo XIV, extending feud over Iran war with first American pontiff</a> - boston.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/638294-trump-claims-weak-pope-leo/'>Trump claims ‘weak’ Pope Leo should be thankful to him</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.politico.eu/article/donald-trump-launches-savage-attack-on-pope-leo/'>‘Weak on Crime, Weak on Nuclear Weapons’: Trump attacks Pope Leo</a> - politico.eu</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/a-president-and-a-pope-two-of-the-worlds-most-influential-americans-at-odds-over-iran'>A president and a pope: Two of the world&#x27;s most influential Americans at odds over Iran</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/inthenews/comments/1sjzgyi/trump_criticizes_pope_leos_stance_on_iran_war/'>Trump criticizes Pope Leo’s stance on Iran war, says he’s ‘not a fan’ of Catholic leader | CNN Politics</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/13/donald-trump-pope-leo'>Donald Trump launches extraordinary attack on Pope Leo calling him ‘weak’ and ‘terrible’</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/04/13/nx-s1-5783008/trump-pope-leo'>Trump lambasts Pope Leo XIV, extending feud over Iran war with American pontiff</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/trump-attacks-pope-leo-calling-him-weak-crime-and-terrible'>Trump attacks Pope Leo, calling him &#x27;weak&#x27; on crime and &#x27;terrible&#x27;</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/unit